# Diagrams

> *Visualizing the architecture, workflows, and operational processes of a Microsoft Sentinel Security Operations Center (SOC).*

---

# Overview

Diagrams are an essential part of security engineering documentation. They simplify complex concepts, illustrate data flow, and provide a visual representation of how Microsoft Sentinel components interact within a Security Operations Center (SOC).

The diagrams in this handbook complement the practical lab by illustrating the lifecycle of security telemetry—from log generation and ingestion to detection, investigation, and incident response.

---

# Objectives

The diagrams in this section are intended to:

- Visualize the Microsoft Sentinel architecture
- Illustrate log ingestion into Azure Monitor
- Explain the threat hunting lifecycle
- Demonstrate the detection engineering process
- Outline the incident investigation workflow
- Show the complete SOC operational lifecycle

---

# Diagram 1 – Microsoft Sentinel Architecture

## Purpose

Illustrates how security telemetry flows through the Microsoft Sentinel platform.

```text
+-----------------------+
|   Linux Server (SSH)  |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
            ▼
+-----------------------+
| Python Log Ingestion  |
| (REST API)            |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
            ▼
+-----------------------+
| Azure Log Analytics   |
| Workspace             |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
            ▼
+-----------------------+
| Microsoft Sentinel    |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
     +------+------+
     |             |
     ▼             ▼
 Threat Hunting  Analytics Rules
     |             |
     +------+------+
            |
            ▼
+-----------------------+
| SOC Investigation     |
+-----------------------+
```

### Components

| Component | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Linux Server | Generates authentication logs |
| Python Script | Uploads logs using the HTTP Data Collector API |
| Log Analytics Workspace | Stores custom log data |
| Microsoft Sentinel | Performs threat detection and monitoring |
| Analytics Rules | Generates alerts based on KQL |
| SOC Analyst | Investigates and responds to incidents |

