# Diagram 2 – Log Ingestion Workflow

## Purpose

Demonstrates how security logs are collected and ingested into Microsoft Sentinel.

```text
Authentication Logs
        │
        ▼
Python Ingestion Script
        │
        ▼
HTTP Data Collector API
        │
        ▼
Azure Log Analytics Workspace
        │
        ▼
Microsoft Sentinel
```

### Description

The Python ingestion script sends custom authentication logs to Azure through the HTTP Data Collector API. Once stored in the Log Analytics Workspace, the logs become available for KQL queries, analytics rules, and investigations within Microsoft Sentinel.

