# Diagram 3 – Threat Hunting Workflow

## Purpose

Illustrates the proactive threat hunting process followed by SOC analysts.

```text
Develop Hypothesis
        │
        ▼
Collect Telemetry
        │
        ▼
Execute KQL Queries
        │
        ▼
Analyze Results
        │
        ▼
Identify Suspicious Activity
        │
        ▼
Escalate Investigation
```

### Description

Threat hunting begins with a hypothesis and leverages KQL to identify anomalies, suspicious behavior, or indicators of compromise that may not trigger automated alerts.

