# Diagram 4 – Detection Engineering Lifecycle

## Purpose

Shows how threat hunting queries are transformed into automated detections.

```text
Security Logs
      │
      ▼
Threat Hunting
      │
      ▼
Develop Detection Logic
      │
      ▼
Validate Query
      │
      ▼
Tune Detection
      │
      ▼
Deploy Analytics Rule
      │
      ▼
Generate Alerts
```

### Description

Detection engineering converts manually validated hunting logic into repeatable Analytics Rules, enabling continuous monitoring and automated alert generation.

